Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamune, ne okuyorsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Zor bir kitaba benziyor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gökyüzü neden mavidir?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu kısmı anlamak cidden zor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Harbiden, neden acaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mavi gökyüzü güzel hissettirmiyor mu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanki, ferah ve köpüklü bir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ramune içiyormuşum gibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anladım.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mavi çok güzel hissettiren bir renk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Haklısın.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ramune rengi.
